#: ../../webgis-src/chb7_mapserver-wcs/sec01_wcs/section.rst:135
msgid "Usage of GetCoverage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../webgis-src/chb7_mapserver-wcs/sec01_wcs/section.rst:137
msgid ""
"``GetCoverage`` returns data, which is raster data. Since the request "
"cannot specify the name and suffix of the file at this time, the file can"
" be downloaded and saved, and modified into a file with ``.tif`` as the "
"suffix. This file has geospatial information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../webgis-src/chb7_mapserver-wcs/sec01_wcs/section.rst:142
msgid ""
"http://webgis.pub/cgi-"
"bin/mapserv?map=/owg/mfw8.map&SERVICE=WCS&VERSION=1.1.0&REQUEST=GetCoverage&IDENTIFIER"
"=world-"
"img&FORMAT=image/tiff&BOUNDINGBOX=43,33,44,34,urn:ogc:def:crs:EPSG::4326"
msgstr ""

